  <office:body>
    <office:spreadsheet>
      <table:table table:name="Laytime">
        <table:table-column table:style-name="coA"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="coB"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="coB"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="coD"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="coE"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="coF"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="coB"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="coB"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="coI"/>
        <table:table-column table:style-name="coD"/>
        <table:table-row table:style-name="rowTitle"><table:table-cell table:style-name="Title" table:number-columns-spanned="10" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Saltmarsh Shipping Ltd – laytime calculation, MV Northern Star</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="9"/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row table:style-name="rowNote2"><table:table-cell table:style-name="NoteWrap" table:number-columns-spanned="10" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Voyage charterparty dated 12 March 2026 – 5,200 tonnes of packaged sawn timber discharged at Hartmouth – laytime and demurrage under clauses 9 and 10. Prepared by Priya Nair, Ashcombe Reeve LLP, 22 September 2026 (our ref TR/1001.1/PN). All times are in 2026, local time at Hartmouth; times in blue are taken from the master’s log and the harbour notices, and everything else is calculated.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="9"/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row table:style-name="rowStd"><table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="10"/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row table:style-name="rowStd"><table:table-cell table:style-name="Section" table:number-columns-spanned="4" office:value-type="string"><text:p>From the charterparty and the master’s log</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="Default"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Default" table:number-columns-spanned="5"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="4"/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row table:style-name="rowStd"><table:table-cell table:style-name="Row" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Laytime allowed (clause 9)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="RowDays2" office:value-type="float" office:value="6.0"><text:p>6.00</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="RowText" office:value-type="string"><text:p>weather working days</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="RowText"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Default"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Default" table:number-columns-spanned="5"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="4"/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row table:style-name="rowStd"><table:table-cell table:style-name="Row" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Demurrage rate (clause 10)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="RowUSD" office:value-type="float" office:value="18000.0"><text:p>USD 18,000.00</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="RowText" office:value-type="string"><text:p>a day, pro rata</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="RowText"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Default"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Default" table:number-columns-spanned="5"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="4"/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row table:style-name="rowStd"><table:table-cell table:style-name="Row" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Notice of readiness given</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="RowDTIn" office:value-type="date" office:date-value="2026-08-03T10:24:00"><text:p>Mon 3 Aug 10:24</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="RowText"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="RowText"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Default"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Default" table:number-columns-spanned="5"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="4"/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row table:style-name="rowStd"><table:table-cell table:style-name="Row" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Discharge completed</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="RowDTIn" office:value-type="date" office:date-value="2026-08-19T16:24:00"><text:p>Wed 19 Aug 16:24</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="RowText"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="RowText"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Default"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Default" table:number-columns-spanned="5"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="4"/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row table:style-name="rowStd"><table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="10"/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row table:style-name="rowStd"><table:table-cell table:style-name="Section" table:number-columns-spanned="4" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Owners’ calculation (Dunmere Pryce LLP, 15 September 2026)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="Default"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Section" table:number-columns-spanned="5" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Charterers’ calculation (clause 9)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="4"/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row table:style-name="rowStd"><table:table-cell table:style-name="ColHead" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Period</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ColHead" office:value-type="string"><text:p>From</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ColHead" office:value-type="string"><text:p>To</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ColHeadRight" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Days</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Default"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ColHead" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Period</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ColHead" office:value-type="string"><text:p>From</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ColHead" office:value-type="string"><text:p>To</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ColHeadCentre" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Counts?</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="ColHeadRight" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Days</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row table:style-name="rowStd"><table:table-cell table:style-name="Row" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Laytime from notice</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="RowDT" table:formula="of:=[.B7]" office:value-type="date" office:date-value="2026-08-03T10:24:00"><text:p>Mon 3 Aug 10:24</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="RowDT" table:formula="of:=[.B12]+[.B5]" office:value-type="date" office:date-value="2026-08-09T10:24:00"><text:p>Sun 9 Aug 10:24</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="RowDays" table:formula="of:=ROUND([.C12]-[.B12];4)" office:value-type="float" office:value="6.0"><text:p>6.0000</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Default"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Row" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Laytime starts (clause 9.2)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="RowDTIn" office:value-type="date" office:date-value="2026-08-04T08:00:00"><text:p>Tue 4 Aug 08:00</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="RowDTIn" office:value-type="date" office:date-value="2026-08-07T00:00:00"><text:p>Fri 7 Aug 00:00</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="RowCentre" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Yes</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="RowDays" table:formula="of:=IF([.I12]=&quot;Yes&quot;;[.H12]-[.G12];0)" office:value-type="float" office:value="2.6666666666666665"><text:p>2.6667</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row table:style-name="rowStd"><table:table-cell table:style-name="Row" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Demurrage to completion</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="RowDT" table:formula="of:=[.C12]" office:value-type="date" office:date-value="2026-08-09T10:24:00"><text:p>Sun 9 Aug 10:24</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="RowDT" table:formula="of:=[.B8]" office:value-type="date" office:date-value="2026-08-19T16:24:00"><text:p>Wed 19 Aug 16:24</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="RowDays" table:formula="of:=ROUND([.C13]-[.B13];4)" office:value-type="float" office:value="10.25"><text:p>10.2500</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Default"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Row" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Weather stoppage (41/26, 42/26)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="RowDT" table:formula="of:=[.H12]" office:value-type="date" office:date-value="2026-08-07T00:00:00"><text:p>Fri 7 Aug 00:00</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="RowDTIn" office:value-type="date" office:date-value="2026-08-09T00:00:00"><text:p>Sun 9 Aug 00:00</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="RowCentre" office:value-type="string"><text:p>No</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="RowDays" table:formula="of:=IF([.I13]=&quot;Yes&quot;;[.H13]-[.G13];0)" office:value-type="float" office:value="0.0"><text:p>0.0000</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row table:style-name="rowStd"><table:table-cell table:style-name="Row"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Row"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Row"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Row"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Default"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Row" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Sunday 9 August, also weather</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="RowDT" table:formula="of:=[.H13]" office:value-type="date" office:date-value="2026-08-09T00:00:00"><text:p>Sun 9 Aug 00:00</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="RowDTIn" office:value-type="date" office:date-value="2026-08-10T00:00:00"><text:p>Mon 10 Aug 00:00</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="RowCentre" office:value-type="string"><text:p>No</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="RowDays" table:formula="of:=IF([.I14]=&quot;Yes&quot;;[.H14]-[.G14];0)" office:value-type="float" office:value="0.0"><text:p>0.0000</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row table:style-name="rowStd"><table:table-cell table:style-name="Row"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Row"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Row"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Row"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Default"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Row" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Weather stoppage continues</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="RowDT" table:formula="of:=[.H14]" office:value-type="date" office:date-value="2026-08-10T00:00:00"><text:p>Mon 10 Aug 00:00</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="RowDTIn" office:value-type="date" office:date-value="2026-08-11T00:00:00"><text:p>Tue 11 Aug 00:00</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="RowCentre" office:value-type="string"><text:p>No</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="RowDays" table:formula="of:=IF([.I15]=&quot;Yes&quot;;[.H15]-[.G15];0)" office:value-type="float" office:value="0.0"><text:p>0.0000</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row table:style-name="rowStd"><table:table-cell table:style-name="Row"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Row"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Row"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Row"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Default"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Row" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Discharge resumes; laytime runs out</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="RowDT" table:formula="of:=[.H15]" office:value-type="date" office:date-value="2026-08-11T00:00:00"><text:p>Tue 11 Aug 00:00</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="RowDT" table:formula="of:=ROUND(([.G16]+([.B5]-SUM([.J12:.J15])))*1440;0)/1440" office:value-type="date" office:date-value="2026-08-14T08:00:00"><text:p>Fri 14 Aug 08:00</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="RowCentre" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Yes</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="RowDays" table:formula="of:=IF([.I16]=&quot;Yes&quot;;[.H16]-[.G16];0)" office:value-type="float" office:value="3.3333333333333335"><text:p>3.3333</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row table:style-name="rowStd"><table:table-cell table:style-name="Default"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Default"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Default"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Default"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Default"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Sub" table:number-columns-spanned="4" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Laytime used</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="SubDays" table:formula="of:=SUM([.J12:.J16])" office:value-type="float" office:value="6.0"><text:p>6.0000</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row table:style-name="rowStd"><table:table-cell table:style-name="Default"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Default"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Default"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Default"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Default"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Row" office:value-type="string"><text:p>On demurrage: every hour counts</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="RowDT" table:formula="of:=[.H16]" office:value-type="date" office:date-value="2026-08-14T08:00:00"><text:p>Fri 14 Aug 08:00</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="RowDT" table:formula="of:=[.B8]" office:value-type="date" office:date-value="2026-08-19T16:24:00"><text:p>Wed 19 Aug 16:24</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="RowCentre" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Yes</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="RowDays" table:formula="of:=IF([.I18]=&quot;Yes&quot;;ROUND([.H18]-[.G18];4);0)" office:value-type="float" office:value="5.35"><text:p>5.3500</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row table:style-name="rowStd"><table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="10"/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row table:style-name="rowStd"><table:table-cell table:style-name="Sub" table:number-columns-spanned="3" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Days on demurrage</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="SubDays2" table:formula="of:=[.D13]" office:value-type="float" office:value="10.25"><text:p>10.25</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Default"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Sub" table:number-columns-spanned="4" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Days on demurrage</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="SubDays2" table:formula="of:=[.J18]" office:value-type="float" office:value="5.35"><text:p>5.35</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row table:style-name="rowStd"><table:table-cell table:style-name="Total" table:number-columns-spanned="3" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Demurrage at the daily rate</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="2"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="TotalUSD" table:formula="of:=ROUND([.D20]*[.B6];2)" office:value-type="float" office:value="184500.0"><text:p>USD 184,500.00</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Default"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Total" table:number-columns-spanned="4" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Demurrage at the daily rate</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="3"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="TotalUSD" table:formula="of:=ROUND([.J20]*[.B6];2)" office:value-type="float" office:value="96300.0"><text:p>USD 96,300.00</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row table:style-name="rowStd"><table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="10"/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row table:style-name="rowDiff"><table:table-cell table:style-name="Diff" table:number-columns-spanned="9" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Difference between the two calculations (owners’ figure less charterers’ figure)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="8"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="DiffUSD" table:formula="of:=[.D21]-[.J21]" office:value-type="float" office:value="88200.0"><text:p>USD 88,200.00</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row table:style-name="rowStd"><table:table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="10"/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row table:style-name="rowStd"><table:table-cell table:style-name="Heading" table:number-columns-spanned="10" office:value-type="string"><text:p>Notes</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="9"/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row table:style-name="rowNote"><table:table-cell table:style-name="NoteWrap" table:number-columns-spanned="10" office:value-type="string"><text:p>1.  Clause 9.2 starts laytime at 08:00 on the working day after notice of readiness, so the charterers’ calculation starts at 08:00 on Tuesday 4 August; the owners count from the notice itself.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="9"/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row table:style-name="rowNote2"><table:table-cell table:style-name="NoteWrap" table:number-columns-spanned="10" office:value-type="string"><text:p>2.  Clause 9.4: no time counts while weather stops discharge. Harbour notices 41/26 and 42/26 and the master’s log put the stoppage at 00:00 on Friday 7 August to 24:00 on Monday 10 August; 9 August was also a Sunday, not used.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="9"/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row table:style-name="rowNote"><table:table-cell table:style-name="NoteWrap" table:number-columns-spanned="10" office:value-type="string"><text:p>3.  Sunday 16 August counts in full because the vessel was already on demurrage (clause 10.2): once on demurrage, every hour counts, including Sundays, holidays and weather.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell table:number-columns-repeated="9"/></table:table-row>
      </table:table>
    </office:spreadsheet>
  </office:body>
</office:document>
